Statistically, several in a row can potentially happen even
to someone who dies 99.5% of the time.  They just have to
play a LOT of games.

However, there are players who *routinely* ascend multiple
times in a row and in fact some manage to ascend the
majority of the time.  So it must be possible to become
good enough at the game to do that.  I suspect it must
